What's new:
• Recording no longer gets stuck when another app takes the microphone — it recovers on its own.
• Starting a recording no longer pauses your music.
• "Record everything" now includes the audio already held in the buffer, not only what comes next.
• Saved recordings show the correct size and length in the gallery.
• No analytics of any kind: nothing leaves your device.
• Clearer notification buttons and a refreshed icon.
